Kora data licence

The footballer data in this folder (pool.json and the files beside it), the
hints that will be written from it, and the cropped photos that will be
copied into this repository are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Share-alike applies because part of the data comes from Wikipedia and from
CC BY-SA photos (decision P29, 4 October 2026).

Sources, with their own licences:

- English and French Wikipedia: article text and infobox facts, CC BY-SA 4.0.
  pool.json records the article each value came from.
- Wikimedia Commons: photos, each under its own file's licence, credited per
  file (author, licence, licence link and file page are stored with it).
- Wikidata: CC0 1.0.
- martj42/international_results (international results and goalscorers):
  CC0 1.0.
- Later, entered by hand: the RSSSF, credited where used.

The code of this repository stays under its own licence (MIT, see the LICENSE
file at the root).
